{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id147494945"}, "name":{"label":"Chris.Jetke"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-04T06:08:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.1"}, "id":{"label":"10900843800"}, "title":{"label":"Might be the best podcast app?"}, "content":{"label":"I switched from apple to overcast years ago after giving all the top ones a try. For my tastes overcast marries simplicity with function better than the other apps do. It doesn't bombard you with more information than you want it to, and it’s not asking you to do anything more than listen to podcasts with it’s help. I’ve recommended it to friends who have continued using it and I will as well. The only negative would be that as my podcast library starts to grow the app starts to chug a bit when I first open it - but that could also be due to the advancing age of my phone. Thanks developers for an app that has given me a pathway to joy for many years.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
