{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id8082899"}, "name":{"label":"Liam in Ohio"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-07T20:04:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2023.9"}, "id":{"label":"10797272990"}, "title":{"label":"Painfully slow"}, "content":{"label":"This was my favourite podcast app, but it has gotten so slow as to be nearly unusable. I’m on an iPhone 11, which is not the latest and greatest, but other podcast apps work just fine. Maybe newer phones are more responsive, but lately with Overcast, I tap, wait, wait some more, go run some errands, come back, and then MAYBE it will respond. Or maybe it didn’t take and you have to tap it again. Fun! Speaking of not responding, don’t even bother trying to get customer support. The developer is both rich and famous, and I pay my annual subscription fee, but don’t expect that to translate into him hiring anyone to do customer service. You will NEVER get a response if you have an issue. Moving on to other apps …", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
